    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343320/extras/7f6c73973d59f442504496abba05a418.avif?t=1688096343\" /></span><br>Welcome to the Stellar Empires, a strategy game where you take control of an Empire, lead it to complete domination by colonizing new planets! The goal of the game is simple - the player has an initial planet and he has to control the armies to capture the enemy planets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer up to 4 players.<br></li><li>Ability to play against AI.<br></li><li>Availability of 20 challenges.<br></li><li>Massive Short-Session Battles.<br></li><li>Tree abilities.<br></li><li>Availability of an automatically generated map.<br></li><li>Simple and clear gameplay.</li></ul>",
